&P346107 = CDLI Literary 000641, ex. 001
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. [...] x nin9 ki ag2 {d}dumu-zi-de3 
#tr.en: ... beloved sister of Dumuzi 
2. [...] x gur3-ru ki ag2 {d}dur7-dur7-e 
#tr.en: Exuding/bearing ..., beloved of Durtur 
