#tr.en: .... spouse(?) ... lap ... 
2. [...] {d#}nin-a2-zi-mu2-a-ra gu3 al#?-[...] x [...] 
#tr.en: He was speaking(?) to lady Ninazimua ... 
3. gi4#?-bi nu-me-en nu-mu-un-da#-[...] 
#tr.en: I(?) am not one who is returning(?), ... 
4. szu nigin2 nu-me-en nu-mu-un#-da#?-[...] 
