&P346191 = CDLI Literary 000514, ex. 001
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. nindaba ku3-ga si sa2-zu 
#tr.en: Your pure properly executed nindaba offerings 
2. szu ku3-zu siskur2 ku3 sikil-e ma-ra-tag-ga-zu 
