15. e2 keszx(|SZU2.HI.AN|){ki} szeg12-zu du8-du8-zu 
#tr.en: Temple of Keš, your brickwork, your fashioned(?) brick 
16. gi-gun4-na!? musz za-gin3 bar-zu du3-a-za 
