&P346517 = CDLI Literary 000351, ex. 154
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
$ beginning broken 
1'. [...] dumu# {d#}en#-[...] 
#tr.en: Ninurta, son of Enlil, hero, who is like you? 
